Texture handles read from memory that the buffer tracker cannot pin to one table are computed for
each draw from the same words the shader reads (Lichii 561f87abe). They failed whole pipelines with
"Unresolved buffer-backed texture expression", about 120 of them when OoT's world loads, and with
them most of its task/mesh draws. Also more instruction forms as Lichii lowers them: USHF.L.U32,
register shifts, TLD.SCR, HSETP2 with a register. Bumps the translator salt.

